# Original practice card. These hands follow the usual American families but are
# not the official NMJL card. Format: family | pattern | points | X (exposed ok) or C (concealed) | run
# a/b/c = three different suits, D = dragon matching that suit, 0 = Soap, F = flower.
# run N = every number may shift up by 0..N (any consecutive / like numbers).

